1 REM FBCS ARR-0153
2 REM CLAIM A-7.2.4.1-04
3 REM TYPE SELF
100 REM A RESIZE MAY ENLARGE ONE DIMENSION IF THE TOTAL STAYS WITHIN THE DECLARED TOTAL (7.2.4.1 l.3213-3215)
110 DIM B(2,5)
120 MAT B = ZER(4,2)
130 IF SIZE(B,1) = 4 AND SIZE(B,2) = 2 AND SIZE(B) = 8 AND MAXSIZE(B) = 10 THEN PRINT "*** TEST PASSED ***" ELSE PRINT &
&"*** TEST FAILED ***"; SIZE(B,1); SIZE(B,2); SIZE(B); MAXSIZE(B)
140 END
